naga-out/
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# Vendored FreeType native binaries (RENDER-004): Etch.Text owns and ships these, so they must be
# tracked despite the blanket *.dll/*.so/*.dylib rules above.
!src/Etch.Text/native/win-x64/freetype.dll
!src/Etch.Text/native/win-arm64/freetype.dll
!src/Etch.Text/native/linux-x64/libfreetype.so
!src/Etch.Text/native/osx/libfreetype.dylib
!src/Etch.Text/native/win-x64/harfbuzz.dll
!src/Etch.Text/native/win-arm64/harfbuzz.dll
!src/Etch.Text/native/linux-x64/libharfbuzz.so
!src/Etch.Text/native/osx/libharfbuzz.dylib
*.png
*.scene
# The *.scene rule above case-insensitively matches the Etch.Scene PROJECT directory
# (on Windows git.core.ignorecase), silently excluding the whole project from the repo.
# Keep the source project tracked; genuine *.scene data files elsewhere stay ignored.
!src/Etch.Scene/
*.ttf
*.otf
docs-site/_site/
*.bak
frame.bmp
debug.txt
dbg.txt
frame0.bmp
docs/
AGENTS.md
ProjectPlan.md
